OL,5,
OL,6,FA radiographer who took sexually
OL,7,Fexplicit photographs of himself while
OL,8,Fon duty has been struck off.
OL,10,FThe Health and Care Professions
OL,11,FTribunal Service (HCPTS) decided at a
OL,12,Freview hearing to remove William
OL,13,FSmethurst, who worked at Blackpool
OL,14,FVictoria Hospital, from its register.
OL,16,FSmethurst was first suspended in 2024
OL,17,Fafter a panel found he had taken the
OL,18,Fpictures in a clinical area of the
OL,19,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
